        "original_id": "7f0ae2dd-c325-53de-8145-83d4309c4e88",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: SAS Technical Services, SAS Group, SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services\n- Places: Arlanda, Stockholm, Solna Municipality, Sweden\n- Topics: aircraft maintenance, airline holding companies, ownership\n\nFacts:\n- SAS Group, formally Scandinavian Airlines System Aktiebolag and trading as SAS Group and SAS AB, is an airline holding company headquartered in the SAS Frösundavik Office Building in Solna Municipality, Sweden.\n- SAS Group owns the aviation services companies SAS Business Opportunities, SAS Cargo Group, SAS Ground Services, and SAS Technical Services.\n- SAS Group is partially owned by the governments of Sweden, Denmark, and Norway, with ownership stakes of 21.4%, 14.3%, and 14.3%, respectively.\n- SAS Technical Services is owned by SAS Group and provides technical maintenance of aircraft to airlines both within and outside SAS Group.\n- SAS Technical Services is headquartered at Arlanda outside Stockholm and has 3,600 employees.",
